# Implementation Plan - Auth Layout Redesign

The goal is to redesign the authentication page into a split-screen layout where the login/sign-up form and a "developer tips" section swap sides with a fluid animation.

## Proposed Changes

### [Auth Components]

#### [MODIFY] [DevTips.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/DevTips.tsx)
- Update the interval to **6 seconds**.
- Ensure a smooth fade-in/fade-out for the tips using `AnimatePresence`.
- Refine the layout to be more flexible for different screen positions.

#### [MODIFY] [AuthContainer.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthContainer.tsx)
- Re-implement the layout using `flex-row` and `flex-row-reverse` toggled by `isSignup`.
- DOM Order: [AuthCard](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.tsx#12-164) (Form) element first, [DevTips](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/DevTips.tsx#25-81) (Tips) element second.
- Login mode (`isSignup = false`) -> `flex-row-reverse` -> Form on RIGHT, Tips on LEFT.
- Register mode (`isSignup = true`) -> `flex-row` -> Form on LEFT, Tips on RIGHT.
- Improve the vertical divider visibility (higher opacity, stronger gradient).
- Ensure the background of the "Tips" side stays distinct from the "Form" side.

#### [MODIFY] [AuthCard.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.tsx)
- Optional: Simplify the component if the toggle logic is fully managed by [AuthContainer](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthContainer.tsx#13-66).

